@startuml
title UML state - synthetic batch credit entry (SIM_BATCH, WP-36)
[*] --> DRAFT : common rules + approval challenge
DRAFT --> QUEUED : step-up proof consumed;\nCore hold (operation = entry id)
DRAFT --> CANCELLED
QUEUED --> CANCELLED : hold released
QUEUED --> SUBMITTED : window close (cutoff or operator)\nimmutable outbound file
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : acknowledgement rejection -> hold released
SUBMITTED --> SETTLED : settlement -> one BATCH_CREDIT
SETTLED --> RETURNED : return in window -> one BATCH_RETURN\nlinked to the credit
SETTLED --> SETTLED : late return -> flagged for review (no posting)
@enduml
